// C010 [?] the rounds finished 64 to 82; in blocks of five matches they went 16-22, 17-20, 12-23 and 19-17, so yachi out-won pinglamb only in the last block and his round-win rate was lowest in the third and highest in the fourth; after fifteen matches it stood 45 to 65
